Data availability

            This study is based on publicly available datasets: mortality counts via Eurostat at https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics–explained/index.php?title=Weekly_death_statistics&stable; temperature values via The European Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts at https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/cdsapp#!/dataset/reanalysis–era5–land?tab=overview; population numbers via Eurostat at https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/demo_r_gind3_esms.htm; and GMST changes via The National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration at https://data.giss.nasa.gov/gistemp/.
          Code availability

            The computer code illustrating the analyses is available via GitHub at https://github.com/BallesterJoan/europe_summer_2022_heat and https://github.com/the-sea-git/impact-eea.
